ordability. Our collections include <strong>natural diamonds, handcrafted minimalist jewelry, and lab-grown diamonds and gemstones<\/strong> - all selected to suit both personal and professional needs.<\/p>","font_family":"lato_n4","font_size":18,"font_size_mobile":14,"line_height":1.6,"paragraph_spacing":16,"text_alignment":"center","max_width":1000,"desktop_width_percent":100,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40,"padding_horizontal":20,"padding_top_mobile":30,"padding_bottom_mobile":30,"padding_horizontal_mobile":15,"text_color":"#494949","background_color":"#ffffff"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_5f2ddfe_gTPq7m"],"settings":{}},"featured_banner_CPDktU":{"type":"featured-banner","blocks":{"image_8E49Ea":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Untitled_design_7fcf1c58-0119-48e4-bc9f-a7d6381d1786.jpg","sub_title":"","color_sub_title":"#000000","title":"","color_title":"#000000","description":"","color_description":"#000000","button":"","url":"\/","style_button":"style_1","content_position":"absolute","vertical_position":"middle","horizontal_position":"center","text_align":"center","padding_content":"0 15px","padding_image":"0 15px","width_image":"100%"}}},"block_order":["image_8E49Ea"],"name":"Wpbingo Banner","settings":{"show":true,"max_width":"1500px","fullwidth":false,"padding":"","margin":"","layout":"style-1","effect":"none"}},"blocks_PPhmDL":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_5f2ddfe_R9kErQ":{"type":"ai_gen_block_5f2ddfe","settings":{"welcome_text":"<p>Whether you are A jewelry designer or professional jeweler searching for exceptional stones, someone who an individual celebrating a meaningful moment, or someone who appreciates <strong>minimalist beauty.<\/strong><br\/><br\/>you’ll find something special here. Our aim is to expand our catalogue with a variety of styles and trends, so every client finds something perfect for their style and story.<br\/><br\/><strong>We believe jewelry should be a blend of beauty, purpose, and value<\/strong> which is why we focus on quality first, offering pieces that you’ll cherish for years. And if you have a custom design idea or rough concept, we’re here to bring it to life with personalized attention.<\/p>","font_family":"lato_n4","font_size":18,"font_size_mobile":14,"line_height":1.6,"paragraph_spacing":16,"text_alignment":"center","max_width":1000,"desktop_width_percent":100,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40,"padding_horizontal":20,"padding_top_mobile":30,"padding_bottom_mobile":30,"padding_horizontal_mobile":15,"text_color":"#494949","background_color":"#ffffff"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_5f2ddfe_R9kErQ"],"name":"Welcome text","settings":{}},"blocks_idzDTL":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_5f2ddfe_Xte9yH":{"type":"ai_gen_block_5f2ddfe","settings":{"welcome_text":"<h2><strong>Our Mission & Values<\/strong><\/h2>","font_family":"lato_n4","font_size":22,"font_size_mobile":14,"line_height":1.6,"paragraph_spacing":16,"text_alignment":"center","max_width":1000,"desktop_width_percent":100,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40,"padding_horizontal":20,"padding_top_mobile":30,"padding_bottom_mobile":30,"padding_horizontal_mobile":15,"text_color":"#868686","background_color":"#ffffff"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_5f2ddfe_Xte9yH"],"name":"Welcome text","settings":{}},"featured_banner_VPhJmU":{"type":"featured-banner","blocks":{"image_Gn7XGF":{"type":"image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-22_at_2.01.25_PM.jpg","sub_title":"","color_sub_title":"#000000","title":"","color_title":"#000000","description":"","color_description":"#000000","button":"","url":"\/","style_button":"style_1","content_position":"absolute","vertical_position":"middle","horizontal_position":"center","text_align":"center","padding_content":"0 15px","padding_image":"0 15px","width_image":"50%"}}},"block_order":["image_Gn7XGF"],"name":"Wpbingo Banner","settings":{"show":true,"max_width":"","fullwidth":false,"padding":"","margin":"","layout":"style-1","effect":"none"}},"1766394967a68eedf5":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_dbe16a5_gLJHW9":{"type":"ai_gen_block_dbe16a5","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-22_at_2.01.25_PM.jpg","desktop_width_percent":40,"mobile_width_percent":90,"section_padding_top":20,"section_padding_bottom":20,"border_radius":0},"blocks":{}},"ai_gen_block_6518161_EeHTA4":{"type":"ai_gen_block_6518161","settings":{"heading":"","text":"<p>At The Minimal Carbon, we are guided by a simple yet meaningful mission :<\/p><p>To deliver high-quality, handcrafted jewelry that reflects elegance with ethical and sustainable practices.<\/p><p><strong>Customer-First Experience:<\/strong> We strive to make your jewelry journey smooth, inspiring, and memorable.<\/p><p><strong>Timeless Designs: <\/strong>Our pieces are rooted in minimalist aesthetics designed to be versatile, elegant, and everlasting.<\/p><p><strong>Quality & Craftsmanship: <\/strong>Each piece is curated or crafted with care and precision, from classic staples to modern trends.<\/p><p><strong>Sustainability:<\/strong> We embrace responsible sourcing and offer ethically sourced and eco-friendly options such as lab-grown and conflict-free diamonds jewelry with beauty and conscience.<\/p><p><strong>Transparent Service: <\/strong>From detailed product care to personalized support, we aim to earn your trust and loyalty in every interaction.<\/p>","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-22_at_2.01.25_PM.jpg","container_width":1200,"content_gap":60,"mobile_gap":30,"section_padding_top":60,"section_padding_bottom":60,"heading_size":36,"heading_spacing":20,"text_size":16,"background_color":"#ffffff","heading_color":"#000000","text_color":"#494949","image_border_radius":8},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_dbe16a5_gLJHW9","ai_gen_block_6518161_EeHTA4"],"settings":{}},"image_text":{"type":"featured-row","disabled":true,"settings":{"max_width":"","fullwidth":false,"padding":"0 15px","margin":"0 0 80px","title":"About Minimal Carbon","desc":"Being a 5-Star Rated Shop on well known worldwide online marketplaces like – Etsy, Ebay, Amazon, we are starting our new journey by launching this platform for our Clients. Through this website platform we can directly meet to our Clients needs without any third-party interference. A Collection of Beautiful Natural Pieces Hand-Picked, with some New Collections of Lab Grown Diamonds & Gemstones are going to be added in this platform. \n\n                    Clients from B2B category to Last Consumers who make purchases for personal use, we try to make a complete Catalogue that meets to our All Kind Of Clients. \n\nFor Our Professional Clients like Jewelry Designers, Goldsmiths, Independent Jewelry Shop Owners we’ll keep trying to add best quality of Diamonds that perfectly matches and meets their Designs. Taking inspirations from our Previous & Current Clients we are working on making our catalogue more Exclusive with modest pricings. The most important thing for us is to provide foremost Quality and Service to our Clients. So that Buyers can prefer Minimal Carbon again & again for future requirements. \n\n                              And for our Last Consumers who make purchase for their personal occasions and use, we are planning on making our Jewelry Catalog more minimalist and one-of-a-kind at some very affordable price ranges. We are also working on expanding our Designs so Clients can have more explorations on latest designs & going on trends. Clients can also make purchase for only Diamonds as well, so that they can set that up on their pre – made designs. We are also welcoming people with their Custom designs or rough designs ideas that they can imagine but have not seen anywhere, we are willing to turn those ideas into Reality that they can wear in Real.","html":"<h6>Store Hours<\/h6><h6>\n<\/h6><p>Monday-Saturday : 11am–7pm ET<\/p>\n<p>Sunday : 11am–6pm ET<\/p>","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/custom_design_...jpg"}},"shipping":{"type":"featured-title-shipping","blocks":{"943d02c4-6e29-4131-afb8-1723db069505":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Free shipping","desc":"We want you to be happy with your purchase. Therefore, shipping is on us and you can return\nyour items up to 90 days."}},"9170ffa1-14d0-4d93-8676-34d4cf218ceb":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Express delivery","desc":"Don’t feel like waiting? Our express delivery service ensures you receive your\nnew items within 5 business days."}},"e68786a4-6484-4398-a289-d3a62df9f911":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"New styles","desc":"We’re constantly designing new styles and collections. Come back soon to discover what’s new and\npick your favourite"}}},"block_order":["943d02c4-6e29-4131-afb8-1723db069505","9170ffa1-14d0-4d93-8676-34d4cf218ceb","e68786a4-6484-4398-a289-d3a62df9f911"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"max_width":"1770px","fullwidth":false,"padding":"0 15px | 0","margin":"0 0 80px","color":"#faf7f4"}},"title":{"type":"featured-title","blocks":{"29c799d3-dc67-47fb-803b-28de4340bba5":{"type":"title","settings":{"title":"Our teams","color":"#000000","font_size":30,"line_height":35,"letter_spacing":0,"font_weight":"300","margin":"0px 0px 0px 0px","align":"center","color_mobi":"#000000","font_size_mobi":25,"line_height_mobi":30,"letter_spacing_mobi":0,"margin_mobi":"0px 0px 0px 0px","align_mobi":"center"}}},"block_order":["29c799d3-dc67-47fb-803b-28de4340bba5"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"max_width":"","fullwidth":false,"padding":"","margin":"0 0 40px"}},"ourteam":{"type":"featured-ourteam","blocks":{"e85dc2f2-c2c4-4e07-ad9d-3395b726f8db":{"type":"ourteam","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_e135b8ff-1dda-4257-b643-ca3ed6583ec5.jpg","name":"Mitesh","job":"Founder","social_facebook_link":"#","social_twitter_link":"#","social_pinterest_link":"","social_instagram_link":"#","social_snapchat_link":"","social_google